## Case: `--help`

### Result

Command:

```text
python -m frog --help
```

Output:

```text
Usage: python -m frog <command> [options]

Commands:
  run [-c CODE | FILE]       compile and run Frog source
  build [-o FILE] [-r] FILE  compile Frog source to a binary
```

